<title>USA: IPO PRICING-Optimal Robotics 3 mln, $5.5.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-Optimal Robotics 3 mln, $5.5.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    Optimal Robotics Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At				     $5.5</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		  $6-7</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			 3 million</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	   Gerard Klauer</p>
<p>NOTES: The underwriter said shares were increased from 2.8 million. Trade date is Oct 25. Settlement date is Oct 30.</p>
<p>Optimal Robotics is located in Montreal and is involved in sales of automated cash register systems in supermarkets.</p>
</text>
